    "scenesThatPass": [
      "DANA: SHE'S NOT HERE YET ——\nTARA: Thanks, did she call?\nDANA: I told her you were in the bathroom. Am I having Deja Vu?\nTARA: Saving me from the walk of shame and coffee, too! Oh booba, what would I do without you?",
      "DANA: That was casual...\nDANA: That was a little warmer than just co- worker, don't you think?\nTARA: Dana --\nTARA: I better get their coats.",
      "DANA: Hey, freaklet. It's us.\nTARA: I don't feel like going out.\nDANA: That's why we're coming in! Hurry up, it's fucking freezing!",
      "TARA: How am I going to know who she is?\nDANA: I brought some pictures.\nTARA: This just seems...impossible.\nDANA: C’mon, we’re just here to look at art like everyone else.",
      "TARA: Hi, excuse me...I just wanted to say I thought your work was really great.\nPIPPA: But let me guess...they don't really go with your decor.\nTARA: Uh...I'm not here to buy, I just wanted to ask where the idea ~-\nPIPPA: JAKE -- Hey, honey!"
    ]
  },
